{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>ונתן. אשר תזרע.</b> After the death of the king of Assyria." "<b>כר.</b> Like ככר הירדן (Genesis 13:10), and likewise בת עין (Psalms 18:7) [is] defective [in its] bet; so abundant will be the seed and the growth."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {1 "The parenthetical (כי) appears in the Hebrew between 'וכן' and 'בת עין'; it is unclear whether it is a variant reading or a gloss, so it has been left untranslated."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:05.006078793Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}